WEBVTT

00:07.420 --> 00:09.280
So, you were here after all.

00:11.260 --> 00:14.660
Himeno's really trying hard. Why don't you accept her?

00:16.460 --> 00:19.520
Last time, she was able to sense the presence of a demon larva.

00:20.500 --> 00:21.170
Himeno?

00:21.170 --> 00:21.930
What's this?

00:23.100 --> 00:24.160
Or...

00:24.840 --> 00:25.940
Are you scared?

00:25.940 --> 00:29.810
Thinking we'll repeat the same mistake we made before?

00:31.820 --> 00:35.090
The boundless future stretches across the skies

00:31.820 --> 00:35.090
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

00:35.090 --> 00:39.130
And I am reborn anew

00:35.090 --> 00:39.130
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

00:39.130 --> 00:46.150
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

00:39.130 --> 00:46.150
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

00:50.110 --> 00:50.310
Prétear

00:58.380 --> 01:05.290
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

00:58.380 --> 01:05.290
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

01:05.290 --> 01:10.080
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

01:05.290 --> 01:10.080
kimerareta ashita wa nai

01:12.130 --> 01:19.030
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

01:12.130 --> 01:19.030
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

01:19.030 --> 01:23.940
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

01:19.030 --> 01:23.940
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

01:25.770 --> 01:29.640
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

01:25.770 --> 01:29.640
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

01:29.640 --> 01:32.780
If the cold wind glimmers

01:29.640 --> 01:32.780
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

01:32.780 --> 01:38.550
I can hear your voice drifting gently

01:32.780 --> 01:38.550
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

01:38.720 --> 01:39.020
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

01:38.720 --> 01:43.490
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

01:43.490 --> 01:46.030
Warms it so much that it hurts

01:43.490 --> 01:46.030
kono mune o atsuku suru

01:46.030 --> 01:48.760
It all begins from the point of believing

01:46.030 --> 01:48.760
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

01:48.760 --> 01:52.430
These feelings are proof of being alive

01:48.760 --> 01:52.430
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

01:52.430 --> 01:52.730
The endless future and the expanding skies

01:52.430 --> 01:55.640
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

01:55.640 --> 01:59.670
Allow me to be reborn anew

01:55.640 --> 01:59.670
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

01:59.670 --> 02:05.780
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

01:59.670 --> 02:05.780
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

02:05.780 --> 02:10.380
Holding hands with you

02:05.780 --> 02:12.380
sono te tsunaide

02:12.580 --> 02:15.940
The Way of Becoming Prétear

02:16.850 --> 02:22.290
Let's see. Well, rum raisin, milk yogurt and casis orange to make it a triple.

02:22.950 --> 02:28.160
Wow, Mr. Tanaka was my stepmother's classmate?

02:28.160 --> 02:33.030
That's right. Information from Yayoi Takato, the Awayuki Watcher, is always correct!

02:33.570 --> 02:35.970
I never knew that, even though it was about my own family.

02:37.170 --> 02:39.370
But I wonder how he feels?

02:39.370 --> 02:42.070
To have become the chauffeur of a woman who was his classmate...

02:42.070 --> 02:45.210
I think there must be some deep circumstances behind this!

02:45.210 --> 02:45.910
Circumstances?

02:45.910 --> 02:50.710
That's right. Looking back on the thirty-plus years leading up today...

02:51.420 --> 02:54.440
Their secret memories piling on top of each other,

02:55.150 --> 02:59.150
...sweet but painful, in the way of romance novels.

02:56.050 --> 02:57.790
My Car

02:59.660 --> 03:02.890
Yes, even now, deep within Mr. Tanaka's heart,

03:02.890 --> 03:06.800
...there's something he cannot speak of without shedding a tear!

03:06.800 --> 03:08.870
It's hot! Bold!

03:08.870 --> 03:10.170
Bolding!

03:11.940 --> 03:14.600
Balding drama!

03:15.810 --> 03:17.240
I don't think so.

03:17.240 --> 03:19.040
Next in line, please.

03:19.040 --> 03:21.010
I'll have a rum raisin.

03:21.010 --> 03:25.910
I'll have a double powdered green tea kimchee with natto yogurt, covered with chocolate chips!

03:28.450 --> 03:29.510
Something the matter?

03:42.770 --> 03:45.470
Special Coverage
Sasame's Words Gate

03:43.130 --> 03:48.500
I see. You apparently lost something very important.

03:49.140 --> 03:50.110
This man is...

03:50.840 --> 03:52.670
Thank you for the postcards, always.

03:53.550 --> 03:55.710
Why does he understand everything?

03:55.710 --> 03:57.580
What is the true identity of the
personality with the beautiful
voice who speaks
to these girls?

03:56.250 --> 03:57.580
Why?

03:57.580 --> 03:59.110
Is strawberry okay?

04:00.150 --> 04:01.020
Himeno?

04:01.020 --> 04:05.050
Hey, that's Sasame's article. You're really a fan of his after...

04:11.260 --> 04:12.320
I wonder if she hates me now?

04:12.860 --> 04:14.350
It's ours!

04:15.370 --> 04:17.400
You ARE careless!

04:17.400 --> 04:19.230
My powdered green tea kimchee!

04:19.870 --> 04:21.460
I'll eat it now!

04:30.450 --> 04:34.450
To not understand the deliciousness of the green tea kimchee, you're still just a child.

04:34.450 --> 04:36.760
Himeno, do you have taste buds?

04:36.760 --> 04:37.520
Himeno!

04:40.060 --> 04:42.060
So there you are, Mr. Only-Good-for-Your-Looks!

04:42.060 --> 04:43.250
Come with me.

04:44.000 --> 04:47.630
I'm going to see if you're worthy of being Prétear.

04:47.630 --> 04:48.430
Come on!

04:49.070 --> 04:50.500
Pervert!

04:52.740 --> 04:55.610
You're saying to prét with you, right?

04:55.610 --> 04:57.740
Like I'll do that! No thanks!

04:57.740 --> 04:59.180
Idiot, that's not it!

05:00.610 --> 05:03.710
There are other ways to see if you're worthy of being Prétear. Come!

05:08.420 --> 05:09.750
A kendama?

05:09.750 --> 05:13.760
Concentration is necessary in battle. I'll test you on that.

05:13.760 --> 05:16.160
You can tell how well I can concentrate with a kendama?

05:16.160 --> 05:18.300
Don't complain, just do it.

05:18.300 --> 05:21.730
What kind of attitude is that?! These kendama are simple.

05:21.730 --> 05:22.890
Watch this!

05:34.650 --> 05:35.910
What?

05:39.450 --> 05:41.320
Why, you!

05:42.990 --> 05:44.510
Ow! This thing's annoying!

05:47.960 --> 05:49.320
Hey, Hayate!

05:49.790 --> 05:52.130
Enough with the kendama already. Next!

05:53.360 --> 05:54.160
Next?

05:56.700 --> 05:58.400
This is a test of your attention skills.

05:58.400 --> 06:00.310
There are certain objects inside this.

06:00.310 --> 06:01.240
Objects?

06:01.240 --> 06:02.900
Can you crack this?

06:03.640 --> 06:10.440
Oh, that's easy. I may not look it, but I'm a black belt under the Sinister Path House Style Karate clan.

06:22.760 --> 06:24.420
Amazing!

06:25.160 --> 06:26.130
How's that?

06:40.650 --> 06:42.250
What the hell were those?!

06:42.250 --> 06:44.180
How many red Tipis were there?

06:45.320 --> 06:47.850
If you were composed and attentive, you should know.

06:47.850 --> 06:50.190
Himeno, how many red ones were there?

06:50.190 --> 06:52.760
How the hell would I know?!

06:52.760 --> 06:54.360
I see, next then.

06:54.360 --> 06:56.460
Hey! Wait a minute, Hayate!

06:56.460 --> 07:00.330
You're doing these spiteful things just to make me give up on being Prétear, right?!

07:00.330 --> 07:02.300
I see right through you!

07:02.300 --> 07:04.460
Hurry up or I'll leave you behind!

07:12.340 --> 07:12.970
I'll eat...

07:14.010 --> 07:15.150
What was that for?

07:15.150 --> 07:16.950
This is the final test.

07:16.950 --> 07:21.150
When a battle drags on, the most important thing is endurance.

07:21.150 --> 07:25.020
With these mountains of snacks in front of you, how long can you...

07:27.990 --> 07:28.890
Empty

07:28.360 --> 07:31.160
Rorry t'disspointoo butah alreddyete.

07:31.160 --> 07:34.070
She said, "Sorry to disappoint you, but I already ate."

07:34.070 --> 07:35.300
Naa, naa!

07:35.300 --> 07:36.460
"Nyaa, nyaa!"

07:37.200 --> 07:38.460
Do as you please!

07:39.700 --> 07:41.140
Hey, Hayate!

07:41.140 --> 07:43.570
Damned joker, I don't care anymore!

07:44.810 --> 07:47.510
I'm sorry, Miss Mayune!

07:47.510 --> 07:50.650
I didn't think the limousine would break down in a place like that!

07:50.650 --> 07:52.840
Never mind the limousine!

07:54.850 --> 07:58.910
No need to worry, everyone. This is nothing.

07:59.460 --> 07:59.920
Oops...

08:00.360 --> 08:00.920
Has it been fi...

08:01.490 --> 08:04.560
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

08:04.560 --> 08:05.760
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

08:05.760 --> 08:06.730
Tanaka!

08:07.600 --> 08:10.360
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

08:11.040 --> 08:14.240
I've never been so embarrassed in my life!

08:14.240 --> 08:16.170
Miss Mayune!

08:17.110 --> 08:18.510
Stop crying! It's annoying!

08:21.450 --> 08:23.210
Watch where you're going!

08:24.820 --> 08:25.680
Sorry.

08:26.120 --> 08:28.380
Oh, my, what a good-looking man.

08:32.060 --> 08:35.230
You bump into a lady and think it can be settled just by saying sorry?

08:35.230 --> 08:36.590
Come with me!

08:36.590 --> 08:38.800
This is all for Miss Mayune's sake, so please bear with it.

08:38.800 --> 08:40.660
Hey, wait a minute!

08:43.640 --> 08:44.640
I see.

08:44.640 --> 08:47.510
What should we do about Himeno and Hayate?

08:47.510 --> 08:49.500
They'll be all right. Leave them alone.

08:50.110 --> 08:51.940
They're not all right!

08:51.940 --> 08:54.250
So, what do you suggest?

08:54.250 --> 08:56.550
They won't listen no matter what you say.

08:56.550 --> 08:59.020
You won't know until you say it.

08:59.550 --> 09:01.250
This is why I dislike children.

09:02.050 --> 09:03.990
Who are you calling a kid?

09:03.990 --> 09:06.260
Anyway, let's just wait a little longer and see what happens.

09:06.260 --> 09:08.260
We can take action later.

09:08.260 --> 09:09.820
If you're done, go home.

09:10.900 --> 09:13.670
Geez, you're cold.

09:13.670 --> 09:17.260
Shouldn't you be the real Knight of Ice?

09:20.000 --> 09:21.470
That Mannen,

09:21.940 --> 09:23.410
...it's frozen.

09:26.110 --> 09:29.010
I see, your name is Hayate.

09:32.780 --> 09:34.950
Be grateful to me, Hayate.

09:34.950 --> 09:38.690
It is an honor to be able to become my personal servant.

09:38.690 --> 09:41.560
Servant? What are you talking about?

09:41.560 --> 09:43.720
When did I say I'd be one?

09:46.560 --> 09:48.400
Hayate, my robe.

09:53.400 --> 09:56.040
Now he will fall head over heels in love with me.

09:56.040 --> 10:01.650
It's a little daring, but for a hard-headed man like him, this is an effective plan.

10:01.650 --> 10:04.210
Hayate, something to drink.

10:04.850 --> 10:06.050
Thank...

10:06.050 --> 10:07.950
What are you doing here?

10:07.950 --> 10:10.860
Yes, I am serving you, Miss Mayune.

10:10.860 --> 10:12.460
What happened to Hayate?

10:12.460 --> 10:14.360
Yes, he left.

10:14.360 --> 10:15.560
He left?!

10:15.560 --> 10:17.360
Yes, he said he'd leave the rest to me.

10:17.360 --> 10:19.630
Say what?!

10:19.630 --> 10:22.700
After making me go this far! Unforgivable!

10:22.700 --> 10:25.860
I'll just have to turn down a man that dense myself!

10:36.810 --> 10:38.340
What's the deal with this?

10:41.790 --> 10:43.150
What a weirdo.

10:48.560 --> 10:49.720
Himeno?

10:56.070 --> 10:59.600
Are you sure you don't need the car today, Ma'am?

10:59.600 --> 11:03.200
Yes, I want to be alone with Kaoru today.

11:04.510 --> 11:05.980
Sorry to keep you waiting!

11:07.040 --> 11:09.550
Oh, Kaoru! It's wonderful!

11:09.550 --> 11:12.350
I'm just melting!

11:12.350 --> 11:15.290
I'll leave you to take care of things, Mikage.

11:15.290 --> 11:16.550
Have a safe trip.

11:16.550 --> 11:21.320
We'll go anywhere we want! Ti-ri-rin, romance!

11:21.860 --> 11:22.560
Here.

11:22.560 --> 11:23.320
Thank you.

11:25.460 --> 11:26.660
A kendama?

11:26.660 --> 11:28.530
Don't you think that's awful?

11:28.530 --> 11:31.990
To think, he said I don't have what it takes to be Prétear because of this.

11:33.040 --> 11:34.910
It's no laughing matter, Sasame.

11:34.910 --> 11:38.210
Oh, sorry, sorry. I just thought it's just like Hayate to do that.

11:38.210 --> 11:42.350
He's just plain stupid. A kendama doesn't mean anything.

11:42.350 --> 11:45.420
No, I think it does.

11:45.420 --> 11:50.010
After all, a kendama is a great toy to increase your concentration.

11:51.360 --> 11:54.520
I'm so envious. You do that so easily.

11:55.790 --> 11:58.030
I wonder if I'm not suited for it after all?

11:58.030 --> 11:59.390
That's not true.

12:02.730 --> 12:06.140
Just because you can't do something well right away doesn't mean you're not suited for it.

12:06.140 --> 12:07.870
Have more confidence in yourself.

12:09.710 --> 12:15.450
You're right. Hayate finally looked me in the eye, so I was trying too hard.

12:15.450 --> 12:19.250
Then I couldn't do it, so I got frustrated and all.

12:22.190 --> 12:24.590
But I feel a lot better after talking with you!

12:24.590 --> 12:26.460
I see, that's good.

12:26.460 --> 12:28.820
And that's why you're Sasame of Words Gate.

12:31.660 --> 12:33.900
Oh, no! I had made a promise to Go.

12:33.900 --> 12:35.500
Sorry, I have to go.

12:35.500 --> 12:37.440
Thanks for everything today. See ya!

12:37.440 --> 12:41.370
Oh, and Sasame, I'll listen to the radio again tonight.

12:42.440 --> 12:43.700
See ya!

12:47.780 --> 12:54.450
Put trash in the
trash bin!

12:54.650 --> 12:56.150
No matter where, however far...

12:56.150 --> 12:59.260
I'm so tired. I wonder how long we'll keep on going?

12:59.260 --> 13:01.490
How is it? Doesn't it feel good?

13:01.490 --> 13:05.460
Oh, of course! It feels good, so good!

13:05.460 --> 13:07.500
I wish I could go on forever like this!

13:07.500 --> 13:10.700
That's great! Then we'll do another twenty or thirty laps around the park!

13:11.840 --> 13:16.270
Tum-dee-tum-dee-tum-dee-dum, we never get tired!

13:19.510 --> 13:20.670
An enemy to the right!

13:24.020 --> 13:25.880
All right! Next, to the left!

13:26.680 --> 13:28.550
So I thought, but there's nothing harmful to the left!

13:29.090 --> 13:31.050
Maybe the real enemy is behind you!

13:49.110 --> 13:50.570
All right! You pass!

13:52.140 --> 13:53.800
You're really getting good, Himeno.

13:54.350 --> 13:55.810
Yeah! You're amazing!

13:57.350 --> 13:58.320
Thanks.

14:01.850 --> 14:05.310
You're moving a lot better. You've made a lot of progress, Himeno.

14:06.690 --> 14:07.660
What?

14:07.660 --> 14:12.520
The way you say things is so funny, it was tough not to laugh through all that.

14:13.360 --> 14:14.870
Sorry, did that make it hard to practice?

14:14.870 --> 14:15.600
Nope.

14:15.600 --> 14:17.340
It was easy.

14:17.340 --> 14:19.270
I see, then great.

14:23.040 --> 14:23.710
What?

14:23.710 --> 14:25.010
Hayate?

14:28.180 --> 14:29.200
You were watching the whole time?

14:31.280 --> 14:32.950
So, how was it?

14:32.950 --> 14:33.940
How was what?

14:34.850 --> 14:36.650
Well, that's...

14:36.650 --> 14:39.850
I was able to use the Prétear's powers effectively, wasn't I?

14:43.660 --> 14:46.500
Even if I can't do well with the kendama, there isn't a problem...

14:46.500 --> 14:47.900
Don't get carried away!

14:48.630 --> 14:50.400
What are you getting so confident for?

14:51.000 --> 14:52.040
What?

14:52.040 --> 14:55.900
You're still no good! You're still an amateur!

14:57.740 --> 14:58.770
I...

14:59.510 --> 15:01.350
I know that!

15:01.350 --> 15:03.210
That's right, I'm still an amateur!

15:03.210 --> 15:06.850
That's why I'm doing my best like this to improve by even a little bit!

15:06.850 --> 15:10.250
So what?! You hate me, don't you?! That's why!

15:10.250 --> 15:13.190
That's why you don't like anything I do, right?!

15:13.190 --> 15:15.590
Why don't you just say it?! Say you hate me!

15:15.590 --> 15:17.290
That's enough! I got it!

15:17.290 --> 15:20.800
I'll beat those demon larvae even if you're not going to help!

15:20.800 --> 15:22.790
I don't need you!

15:23.430 --> 15:24.490
Himeno!

15:25.240 --> 15:26.260
Understood.

15:34.350 --> 15:35.540
It's over.

15:40.480 --> 15:44.060
Isn't it great to eat these convenience store lunches outdoors once in a while?

15:44.060 --> 15:46.290
Oh, of course.

15:46.290 --> 15:49.120
As long as I'm with you, it doesn't matter what we get.

15:51.060 --> 15:53.760
Why did I say something like that to him?

15:53.760 --> 15:57.740
"I don't need you," the words I hate the most.

15:57.740 --> 16:01.610
No matter how wrong Hayate was, I'm the worst.

16:01.610 --> 16:05.940
Himeno, he probably wanted to accept you.

16:06.840 --> 16:09.050
But you know he's not honest with himself at all, right?

16:09.050 --> 16:11.850
So that's probably why he made you go through those weird tests.

16:11.850 --> 16:14.150
To accept me?

16:14.150 --> 16:17.250
That's right! He probably figured you'd be able to do the kendama,

16:17.250 --> 16:19.060
...so he tried to build your confidence that way.

16:19.060 --> 16:21.050
Hey! Go! No!

16:21.960 --> 16:23.320
Couldn't do it...

16:26.900 --> 16:29.590
Himeno! Want something to eat? My treat!

16:31.800 --> 16:34.440
Well? Cake or parfait? There's even pudding!

16:34.440 --> 16:35.540
Demon larva...

16:35.540 --> 16:36.870
Demon...

16:37.440 --> 16:38.410
Demon larva?!

16:43.350 --> 16:45.480
Are you getting thirsty, Natsue?

16:45.480 --> 16:47.050
Come to think of it, yes.

16:47.050 --> 16:48.150
Here you go, Natsue.

16:48.150 --> 16:50.020
Oh, thank you, Kaoru.

16:50.490 --> 16:51.750
Somehow...

16:52.290 --> 16:54.880
I'm becoming sleepy for some reason.

16:55.430 --> 16:57.290
Dad! Mother!

17:04.140 --> 17:04.760
Damn!

17:07.240 --> 17:08.510
Himeno, now!

17:08.510 --> 17:09.410
Go!

17:09.410 --> 17:10.200
Gotcha!

17:42.040 --> 17:43.170
<i>Beyondios!</i>

17:53.050 --> 17:54.520
All right! One more!

17:54.890 --> 17:56.050
Hajime! Mannen!

18:00.160 --> 18:01.450
The demon larvae multiplied?!

18:01.760 --> 18:02.420
Hajime!

18:18.110 --> 18:18.870
Everyone!

18:34.730 --> 18:35.790
Hayate!

18:35.790 --> 18:38.660
We'll take care of the small fry. Hurry up and hit the core!

18:40.730 --> 18:41.490
The core...

18:45.140 --> 18:46.000
Found it!

18:46.900 --> 18:48.700
Fire Axe!

18:54.350 --> 18:55.840
Eat this!

19:17.230 --> 19:19.200
Natsue! Natsue!

19:20.500 --> 19:23.640
Oh, my! How embarrassing!

19:23.640 --> 19:27.210
Well, I fell asleep too, maybe because it was so warm and comfortable out here.

19:29.150 --> 19:30.480
Oh, Kaoru, look.

19:30.480 --> 19:32.750
Yeah, what a beautiful sunset.

19:32.750 --> 19:34.510
Yes, it really is.

19:35.050 --> 19:37.150
How peaceful the world is.

19:37.150 --> 19:41.290
You're right, Kaoru. It's as though we are blessed by everything.

19:41.290 --> 19:43.450
Oh, geez, they're oblivious to how we feel.

19:44.930 --> 19:46.990
Say, everyone. Are you all right?

19:48.100 --> 19:49.330
No problem.

19:49.330 --> 19:52.360
Go, I got you hurt. Sorry.

19:53.400 --> 19:57.170
No need to apologize. I'm a Leafe Knight, so it's my job.

20:00.140 --> 20:01.110
Hayate...

20:02.150 --> 20:06.410
Well, I'm really sorry for saying such horrible things earlier today.

20:09.250 --> 20:10.220
Hayate!

20:11.290 --> 20:13.690
Those words certainly did hurt.

20:14.390 --> 20:15.230
Hayate!

20:15.230 --> 20:18.300
Unfortunately, I'm a Knight as well.

20:18.300 --> 20:21.230
Even if I'm working with a stupid Prétear who annoys me,

20:21.230 --> 20:24.790
...it's not like I can just not help. It's my job.

20:25.600 --> 20:30.910
Who're you calling an idiot who annoys you and a violent bitch?!

20:30.910 --> 20:32.940
He didn't say that.

20:32.940 --> 20:34.910
Man, I'm hungry.

20:37.450 --> 20:40.250
He gets on my nerves after all.

20:46.060 --> 20:47.920
I did it!

20:49.560 --> 20:51.300
I said, I did it!

20:51.300 --> 20:53.590
Hey, Hayate! Are you listening?

20:54.730 --> 20:57.630
Mom, for some reason, I'm very happy.

20:57.630 --> 20:59.400
I'm still an amateur.

21:00.000 --> 21:02.500
But I'm going to do my best for my friends!

21:03.240 --> 21:04.840
So he's finally accepted it.

21:04.840 --> 21:06.340
Accepted what?

21:06.340 --> 21:07.970
Accepted you, Himeno.

21:08.680 --> 21:13.310
He certainly did say it, "A stupid Prétear who annoys me."

